{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure where you play as <strong>Rei</strong>, a girl left alone after the passing of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/c565b7891d7aaf19544d286b21f886d4.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/c565b7891d7aaf19544d286b21f886d4.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/c565b7891d7aaf19544d286b21f886d4.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free them, Rei must explore a mystical world, solve light environmental puzzles, and help the Zodiac spirits confront their personal struggles and sever the spiritual bonds that keep them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4c9e05e188e4cf6b3dd67ae5f39117fd.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4c9e05e188e4cf6b3dd67ae5f39117fd.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4c9e05e188e4cf6b3dd67ae5f39117fd.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>beautiful rural Japanese village</strong> and cross into <strong>mystical realms</strong> tied to the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor. The game's visuals shift between grounded reality and colorful spiritual dreamscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/553d4bfb4bd0a1fe898349ad2629ab1b.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/553d4bfb4bd0a1fe898349ad2629ab1b.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/553d4bfb4bd0a1fe898349ad2629ab1b.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/a1507f4cfc8ae51214f5888ad383c052.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relationships &amp; Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/778cd7768679f1e26eef58b3df627a4b.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the twelve <strong>Zodiac spirits</strong> and uncover their emotional conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about their ties to the Jade Emperor and help them find resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.poster.avif?t=1760653116\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.webm?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/8aeba2bd7cafe95cd26a3f607019b560.mp4?t=1760653116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonds appear as <strong>tangible strings</strong>\u2014find ways to sever them and guide the spirits toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.5 to 2.5 hours</strong> of emotionally driven storytelling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and light puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices that shape Rei\u2019s relationships and story arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, melancholic, and tense music tracks that evolve with the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A free demo is available now! Try it and experience the world of Bonds of the Zodiac.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assets Included in the Steam Capsules:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;anime 3d model&quot; by samiibrahem614 available on Sketchfab under CC:BY 4.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wooden Sign With Roof&quot; by KenVeel available on Sketchfab under CC:BY 4.0 (Changed Texture)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805400?t=1760653116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/4967e8b92110cfdc7c7fbe7a70e464c248ef2e11/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760653116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/0b3b641dff1d5d5805d4c785b2bdab579a737f97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760653116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/0b3b641dff1d5d5805d4c785b2bdab579a737f97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760653116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores mature themes such as loss, imprisonment, and hopelessness, and includes mild profanity and coarse language."},"demos